<title>PHILIPPINES: Fil-Estate Q1 net 455 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Fil-Estate Q1 net 455 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fil-Estate Land Inc said on Monday it made a group net income of 455.02 million pesos in the first three months ended December 31, 1996 compared with 312.63 million pesos in the year-ago quarter.</p>
</text>
